        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo Joasi mwami wa-Juda wakabweza zintu zyoonse zisalala nzibakasalazizye Josafati a-Joramu aAhaziya bamawisi, bami ba-Juda, azintu nzyaakasalazizye mwini, angolida yoonse iyakajanwa muziyobwedo zyaŋanda ya-Jehova azyaŋanda yamwami, wazituma kuli-Hazaeli mwami wa-Aramu, aboobo Hazaeli wakaleka kuya kuyoolwisya Jerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
